sequenceDiagram
  participant DF as DataFiles
  participant DM as DataManager
  participant ETL as ETL (Clean/Normalize)
  participant FE as Feature Eng.
  participant TR as Trainer
  participant RT as Runtime
  participant UI as UI (RiskMap/CircuitViewer)

  DF->>DM: Provide session/lap/frame files (~20GB)
  DM->>ETL: Stream chunks (validated schema)
  ETL->>FE: Normalized frames per track
  FE->>TR: Feature matrices + labels
  TR-->>RT: Models + thresholds
  RT->>UI: Risks & Recommendations
  UI-->>RT: User feedback/telemetry updates